#. Key:	AutoPrefixHelp
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/AutoPrefix/AutoPrefix.cpp(72)
#: Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/AutoPrefix/AutoPrefix.cpp(72)
msgctxt "AutoPrefixTool,AutoPrefixHelp"
msgid "使用方法：\n  1. 在下方规则表里选择 目标类 及其 前缀\n  2. 填好表后可点击 保存配置 保存当前配置\n  3. 点 应用到项目设置 把当前这套写进 DefaultGame.ini 并生效\n  4. 之后新建蓝图/资产时，重命名输入框的默认值就会变成对应前缀\n  5. 改乱了可点 重置默认值 ，把当前配置恢复为默认前缀（需再点 应用到项目设置 才生效）\n  6. 本插件只接管蓝图/资产的前缀；C++ 类保持引擎原生"
msgstr "Usage:\n  1. In the rule table below, select the Target Class and its Prefix\n  2. After filling the table, click Save Configuration to save the current configuration\n  3. Click Apply to Project Settings to write this set into DefaultGame.ini and take effect\n  4. When creating new Blueprints/assets afterwards, the default value in the rename box becomes the corresponding prefix\n  5. If messed up, click Reset to Defaults to restore the current configuration to the default prefix (requires clicking Apply to Project Settings again to take effect)\n  6. This plugin only manages prefixes for Blueprints/assets; C++ classes remain native to the engine"

