#. Key:	Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/SpawnMaterial/SpawnMaterial.cpp(85)
#: Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/SpawnMaterial/SpawnMaterial.cpp(85)
msgctxt "SSpawnMaterial,Desc"
msgid "本工具将内容浏览器中选中的纹理贴图，根据文件名关键词自动识别贴图通道类型（基础色 / 法线 / ORM / 粗糙度 / 金属度 / 自发光 / 透明度等），并据此生成材质球。"
msgstr "This tool automatically recognizes the texture channel type (Base Color / Normal / ORM / Roughness / Metallic / Emissive / Opacity, etc.) from the selected texture maps in the Content Browser based on filename keywords, and generates a material accordingly."

#. Key:	Usage
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/SpawnMaterial/SpawnMaterial.cpp(94)
#: Plugins/ToolsBox/Source/ToolsBox/Private/Tools/SpawnMaterial/SpawnMaterial.cpp(94)
msgctxt "SSpawnMaterial,Usage"
msgid "使用方法：\n  1. 在内容浏览器中选中一个或多个纹理贴图（除此之外也可以加选一个或多个模型）\n  2. 在下方设置保存路径与生成模式\n  3. 点击「生成材质」按钮（如果选择中包含模型，生成的材质会赋予给对应的模型，前提是模型命名规范）\n"
msgstr "Usage:\n  1. Select one or more texture maps in the Content Browser (you can also additionally select one or more models)\n  2. Set the save path and generation mode below\n  3. Click the Generate Material button (if models are included in the selection, the generated material is assigned to the corresponding models, provided the models are named correctly)\n"

