msgid "使用方法：\n  1. 两边选择要互相复制的蓝图类（拖动前按住shift为复制，alt为剪切）\n  2. 将要复制或剪切的变量，宏，函数等拖进对方待处理区域内\n  3. 点击 确定 即可生效\n"
msgstr "Usage:\n  1. Select the Blueprint classes to copy between on both sides (hold Shift before dragging to copy, Alt to cut)\n  2. Drag the variables, macros, functions, etc. you want to copy or cut into the other side's pending area\n  3. Click OK to apply\n"

